    <dashboard name='Readme'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/WorkbookDashforSiteOwners/Readme?rev=' id='Readme' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/WorkbookDashforSiteOwners' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98000' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='24'>Glossary</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- We have introduced the new &apos;Your Content&apos; tab which is auto filtered for your user. Here you can find a quick overview of all the content owned by you in Tableau like projects, workbooks and views within a chosen timeframe using the date filter.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- Another new addition is the &apos;Content Overview&apos; tab which includes the content threshold parameter that allows the user to enter an average load time theshold to filter for the relevent content. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='24'>Workbook best practises</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>1) Try to keep the number of data sources to 1 per workbook</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>2) Extract the data (don’t use live)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>3) The workbook size should be kept as small as possible (hopefully less than 10MB. Certainly no bigger than ~100MB)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>4) If the workbook is to be a daily KPIs subscription report, the number of views must be kept as low as possible (1-5 would be good, certainly no more than 10)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>5) If you want to send identical subscriptions to multiple people, please consider instead subscribing a mailing list (Tableau is stupid and regenerates the entire email from scratch without caching for each subscription, so 50 subscriptions is 50x more load on the server than 1)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='24'>How to prioritise which Workbooks to fix?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>To help us prioritise which workbooks need improving first, we&apos;ve put together a score based upon the impact on the server. For now it&apos;s a little bit arbitrary but it&apos;s a start. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Workbook Score = </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>(([Num. Views]-1) * 1)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>+ IF ISNULL([Num. Datasources]) THEN 50 ELSE (([Num. Datasources]-1) * 1) END</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>+ ([Workbook Size (MB)] / 5)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>+ (IFNULL([Total Extract Time 1d (m)], 0) * 10)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>+ (IFNULL([Total Subscription Time 1d (m)], 0) * 10)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>+ (IFNULL([Median Load Time (s)], 0))</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>+ (IFNULL([Total Load Time 1d (m)], 0) * 10)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Then we&apos;re assigning an importance based upon the number of users using the workbook, </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Importance = </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>  IF [Distinct Users 7d] &gt;= 201 THEN &quot;1. Extreme&quot;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>  ELSEIF [Distinct Users 7d] &gt;= 51 THEN &quot;2. Very High&quot;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>  ELSEIF [Distinct Users 7d] &gt;= 21 THEN &quot;3. High&quot;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>  ELSEIF [Distinct Users 7d] &gt;= 6 THEN &quot;4. Medium&quot;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>  ELSEIF [Distinct Users 7d] &gt;= 0 THEN &quot;5. Low&quot;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>  ELSEIF ISNULL([Distinct Users 30d]) THEN &quot;7. Zero&quot;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>  ELSE &quot;6. Very Low&quot;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>  END</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='156' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='84000' id='155' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='84000' x='8000' y='8000'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98000' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
